---
title: "emode::support_asset (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_group: groups.contains(group)?
    q_check_group --> q_error_group: group not exists
    q_check_group --> q_check_dup: group exists
    q_error_group --> [*]: abort emode_group_not_exists
    q_check_dup --> q_error_dup: asset already supported
    q_check_dup --> q_create_emode: asset not yet supported
    q_error_dup --> [*]: abort emode_group_already_supports_asset
    q_create_emode --> q_add_collateral: EMode { id: object::new() }
    q_add_collateral --> q_add_borrow: dynamic_field(EModeCollateral)
    q_add_borrow --> q_add_flash: dynamic_field(EModeBorrow)
    q_add_flash --> q_add_limiter: dynamic_field(EModeFlashLoan)
    q_add_limiter --> q_store: dynamic_field(EModeRateLimiter)
    q_store --> q_init_borrow: group.assets.store(emode)
    q_init_borrow --> [*]: group.assets_borrows.store(zero)

    note right of q_create_emode
        INV-001: Each asset in an emode group has unique collateral/borrow/flash_loan params
        INV-002: assets_borrows initialized to zero for new asset
        INV-003: deposit and borrow limiters created per asset per emode group
        INV-004: one asset can exist in multiple emode groups with different params
    end note
